=head1 DESCRIPTION

The status of an inbound cross-cluster connection for OpenSearch
Service.

=head1 ATTRIBUTES


=head2 Message => Str

Information about the connection.


=head2 StatusCode => Str

The status code for the connection. Can be one of the following:

=over

=item *

B<PENDING_ACCEPTANCE> - Inbound connection is not yet accepted by the
remote domain owner.

=item *

B<APPROVED>: Inbound connection is pending acceptance by the remote
domain owner.

=item *

B<PROVISIONING>: Inbound connection is being provisioned.

=item *

B<ACTIVE>: Inbound connection is active and ready to use.

=item *

B<REJECTING>: Inbound connection rejection is in process.

=item *

B<REJECTED>: Inbound connection is rejected.

=item *

B<DELETING>: Inbound connection deletion is in progress.

=item *

B<DELETED>: Inbound connection is deleted and can no longer be used.

=back




